  "authority_rules": [
    "Omniva determines postcode assignments; Maa- ja Ruumiamet AKS distributes Sihtnumbri alad geometry without becoming the assignment authority.",
    "AKS capabilities state that externally sourced geometry may have additional terms; the exact scope of Omniva database publication restrictions over the AKS polygon artifact must be resolved before AGID publication.",
    "The WFS advertises a 5,000-feature cap and non-transaction-safe paging; two live pages and an observed SHA-256 do not establish one immutable national release.",
    "The layer metadata omits a release edition, validity date and metadata date; stamp_cre values are observations, not a declared publication edition.",
    "Invalid source topology receives no buffer, simplification, convex hull, administrative boundary or AGID-cell replacement.",
    "Postal areas are not address, building, cadastral or administrative geometry. Exact address/building context requires a separate permitted ADS relation.",
    "Facility, route, P.O. box, organization and other point/non-area codes receive no invented surface."
  ]
